          "",
          "   sina    I don't have",
          "   huna    you don't have",
          "   hana    she doesn't have",
          "   hatuna  we don't have",
          "   hamna   you all don't have",
          "   hawana  they don't have",
          "",
          "   Sina hela.        I have no money.",
          "   Hawana deni.      They have no debt.",
